# Omarchy owns ~/.config/omarchy/shell.json. It rewrites it whenever the bar or
# a plugin changes (keeping its own shell.json.bak-* beside it), so the copy
# sitting here is a per-machine snapshot that only ever goes stale. Managed by
# the Omarchy system, not by the dotfiles.
